00000101 00000001 00000000 # instruction | ADD AX,0001 | Low-word result zero with outgoing carry.
10001001 11000011 # instruction | MOV BX,AX | Save low word; MOV preserves carry.
10111000 11111111 11111111 # instruction | MOV AX,FFFF | High word; carry remains set.
00010101 00000000 00000000 # instruction | ADC AX,0000 | High word plus carry wraps to zero with carry still set.
10001001 11000001 # instruction | MOV CX,AX | Save high word.
10111000 00000000 00000000 # instruction | MOV AX,0000 | Prepare an extension word while preserving carry.
00010101 00000000 00000000 # instruction | ADC AX,0000 | Extension becomes one and clears carry.
10001001 11000010 # instruction | MOV DX,AX | DX:CX:BX is 0001:0000:0000.
10111000 00000000 00000000 # instruction | MOV AX,0000 | Low word of an all-zero value.
