10001001 11000110 # instruction | MOV SI,AX | Save the low-word result without consuming borrow.
10111000 00000000 00000000 # instruction | MOV AX,0000 | Prepare the next word; borrow survives MOV.
00011101 00000000 00000000 # instruction | SBB AX,0000 | Subtract the incoming borrow, producing FFFF with borrow.
10001001 11000111 # instruction | MOV DI,AX | Save the middle word.
10111000 00000000 00000000 # instruction | MOV AX,0000 | Prepare the final extension word.
00011101 00000000 00000000 # instruction | SBB AX,0000 | Borrow propagates into the final FFFF word.
10001001 11000101 # instruction | MOV BP,AX | BP:DI:SI is FFFF:FFFF:FFFF.
10111000 11111111 10101011 # instruction | MOV AX,ABFF | A distinct AH proves byte alias preservation.
11111001 # instruction | STC | Supply the incoming byte carry.
